  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study on acces to employment for refugees in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Refugees face legislative and administrative constraints to access the labour market. The study will provide the EU with accurate information about legislation in force, donor&apos;s practices and recommendations to foster better access to the labour market in order to facilitate the EU to define specifc guidelines to be implemented under EU financed contracts. (This study responds also to a HQ request)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This contract also aims at supporting the EU in identification of future livelihood programmes targeting the most vulnerable including refugees.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
